{
  "title": "Modified method Cart.tax to leave a cart under ten dollars untaxed",
  "context": [
    "A small cart was taxed like any other. A cart under ten dollars now has no tax in its total.",
    "",
    "## Overview",
    "",
    "- **When** a client posts a cart with a subtotal of 999 cents to `/cart/total`, **then** [the total is 999 cents](code:shop/cart.py#L15-16). It was 1199 cents before.",
    "- **When** a client posts a cart with a subtotal of 1000 cents, **then** nothing changes: the total is 1200 cents.",
    "- **When** a client posts a cart with no lines, **then** nothing changes: the total is 0.",
    "",
    "## Implementation",
    "",
    "**`shop/cart.py`**",
    "",
    "- Modified [`Cart.tax()`](code:shop/cart.py#L14-17) to return 0 for a cart with a subtotal under 1000 cents."
  ],
  "diff": [
    "diff --git a/shop/cart.py b/shop/cart.py",
    "--- a/shop/cart.py",
    "+++ b/shop/cart.py",
    "@@ -14,0 +15,2 @@ class Cart:",
    "+        if self.subtotal() < 1000:",
    "+            return 0"
  ],
